# The gateway image needs only the web app's source and the Caddyfile. Everything else (secrets in
# deploy/.env, databases, virtualenvs, and above all a local node_modules built for another OS) stays out.
*
!TalkTrading-main/TalkTrading-main
TalkTrading-main/TalkTrading-main/node_modules
TalkTrading-main/TalkTrading-main/dist
TalkTrading-main/TalkTrading-main/.env*
!deploy/Caddyfile
